          "items": [
            "30a Beach Properties presents Madison Cottage. When it comes to South of 30-A homes in Rosemary Beach, one of the true favorites of families for many returning families is The Madison Cottage. The location is just so ideal being across from the Barbados Pool and then just a 1 minute walk your beach access gate, and also the cafes on Main Street in Rosemary Beach. And it's a great floor plan for larger groups - a large open 1st floor for kitchen, living, and dining. The third floor has our very neat bunk area that is hard to beat - 7 twin bunks plus 2 bathrooms. (You might also consider getting the very cozy carriage that has everything you need). <br><br>We provide passes to access all 4 Rosemary Beach Community pools, and any of the 9 Beach Walkovers<br><br>All towels, bed linens, blankets, comforters, and pillow/mattress protectors are professionally laundered for every new reservation! <br><br>Features include a 4 bedroom / 5.5 bath cottage. Adding the carriage gets you to 5 bedrooms, rented separately. Two courtyards and a great outdoor Viking Grill complements the exterior. Newly refurnished, this family friendly home is clean, spacious and welcoming. We would love for to host your group!<br> <br>301 West Water Street, Rosemary Beach<br>Sleeps 13 <br>3 kings<br>7 bunks<br>1 Garage Parking Space, Fits Suv: Tahoe, X7, Expedition. Extended suvs will not fit. Passes for street parking additional cars provided.<br><br>The three story floor plan has been designed to accommodate large groups, but is also very comfortable for smaller groups too! <br><br>Located south of 30-A, directly across from the Barbados Pool<br>1 minute walk to the beach walkover<br>Gulf views from bedroom balconies<br>Well-appointed 4 bedroom, 3000 sf home sleeps 12 in beds. Each bedroom has its own ensuite bathroom. The third floor oversized bunk room has two bathrooms. Hardwood flooring on all three floors.<br><br>For an additional fee, the Madison carriage sleeps 3 (VRBO# 1748404) and is rented separately.<br><br>First floor:<br>Large, bright, open floor plan<br>Gourmet Viking kitchen <br>Two kitchen islands, 6-burner gas stove, large refrigerator, two sinks, microwave, granite countertops<br>Dining room<br>Family room with two sofas<br>Brand new 65\" Smart TV and Wi-Fi<br>Wet bar with wine cooler, sink and ice maker <br>Powder room bathroom<br>Walk-in pantry off the kitchen <br>Built-in desk with games, DVDs, puzzles, game table<br><br>Second floor:<br>3 king bedrooms with private bathrooms (2 with tubs)<br>Laundry room with large washer/dryer, laundry sink, iron and ironing board.<br><br>Third floor:<br>7 built-in twins (2 are bunks)<br>2 full bathrooms<br>Large flat screen TV and DVD player<br><br>The two outdoor patio areas provides a pleasant atmosphere for socializing with family and friends. Furnished with teak table/chairs and sofas. Outdoor Viking gas grill.<br>301 West Water Street is south of 30-A, a 1 to 2 minute walk from Rosemary Beach's finest restaurants. It is directly across from the Barbados Pool (one of four pools in Rosemary Beach, including 1 indoor) and just seven homes north of the gulf with gulf views from the balconies. Our beach access is walkover 'I'.<br><br>No pets<br>No smoking<br><br>Take part in the many activities of Rosemary Beach with 2 pools on the beach side and 2 more pools (including an indoor pool) on the north side. Enjoy a stroll on the 2.3mi Fitness and Walking Trails throughout Rosemary Beach. There are 2 outdoor children's play areas. Tennis and fitness centers are available by daily fee.",
